    "No supplied evidence equates the 2007 'Citizen Advisory Committee' with the 'Comprehensive Plan Advisory Committee' or any other configured body, despite the Vision 2030-era topic sections in the video index.",
    "No supplied evidence proves that the City Council or any other body convened or participated in the June 1, 2007 recording; the City Secretary packet (citizen-council-june2007) covers the May 22, 2007 Council meeting and a later Work Session item on 'the Process for Receiving the Citizen Advisory Committee Recommendations,' not the recorded event itself, so no joint-meeting participants can be named."
